				<a href="#projects" class="p-4 md:border-r border-b md:border-b-0 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-250">02. Repository</a>
				<a href="#contact" class="p-4 md:border-r border-b md:border-b-0 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-250">03. Interface</a>
				<div class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between">
					<span>Rec. WF/LR2-4337H</span>
