					</div>

					
				</div>
				<div class="md:col-span-8 px-6 pb-6 md:p-6 gap-6 md:border-l border-black flex flex-col relative justify-between">
					<p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight">
						Computer Science student at UWaterloo.
						Backend Developer and Reviewer at satellite design team, UW Orbital. 
						Currently building mission-critical ground station systems. 
						Dedicated to creating web applications to improve everyday life.
					</p>
					<div class="flex justify-between">
						<div class="flex gap-6">
							<a href="https://github.com/Syzygicality" target="_blank" aria-label="GitHub" 
							class="w-12 h-12 border border-black flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors group duration-250">
