					lectus ante, rutrum sed sodales in, dapibus a justo.
				</p>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 border-black">
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
						<div class="border-b border-black pb-1 text-center">
							<span class="font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Languages</span>
